<title>POLAND: OKOCIM MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.16 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.75 vs   0.83</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.61 vs   1.64</p>
<p> Sales		   22.87 vs  12.03</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.44 vs   3.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.09 vs   5.37</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.37 vs   7.42</p>
<p> Sales		   57.22 vs  33.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Okocimskie Zaklady</p>
<p>Piwowarskie SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
